#: templates/crush_lu/crush_connect.html:82
msgid ""
"One promise across all of them: every introduction is chosen — by a coach or "
"for a coach — never scrolled."
msgstr ""
"Ein Versprechen für alle: Jede Vorstellung wird ausgewählt — von einem Coach "
"oder für einen Coach — nie gescrollt."

#: templates/crush_lu/crush_connect.html:91
#: templates/crush_lu/crush_connect/experiences/coach-pick.html:5
#: templates/crush_lu/crush_connect/experiences/coach-pick.html:16
#: templates/crush_lu/crush_connect/home.html:23
