msgstr "so funktioniert's"

#: templates/crush_lu/crush_connect/experiences/coach-pick.html:34
msgid ""
"Your coach studies your Connect profile — your intention, your lifestyle, "
"what you're looking for."
msgstr ""
"Dein Coach studiert Dein Connect-Profil — Deine Absicht, Deinen Lifestyle, "
"das, was Du suchst."

#: templates/crush_lu/crush_connect/experiences/coach-pick.html:40
msgid ""
"Once a week, their pick takes over your Drop as the hero card — with a note "
"explaining why this person, for you."
msgstr ""
"Einmal pro Woche übernimmt seine Auswahl Deinen Drop als Hauptkarte — mit "
"einer Notiz, warum diese Person, für Dich."

#: templates/crush_lu/crush_connect/experiences/coach-pick.html:46
msgid ""
"Say yes and your coach contacts you both to arrange the date. Decline and it "
"stays between you and your coach."
msgstr ""
"Sag Ja, und Dein Coach kontaktiert euch beide, um das Date zu organisieren. "
"Lehnst Du ab, bleibt es zwischen Dir und Deinem Coach."

#: templates/crush_lu/crush_connect/experiences/coach-pick.html:55
msgid "See this week's pick"
msgstr "Auswahl dieser Woche ansehen"

#: templates/crush_lu/crush_connect/experiences/coach-pick.html:60
msgid "Get your own coach — first month free"
msgstr "Hol dir deinen eigenen Coach — erster Monat gratis"

#: templates/crush_lu/crush_connect/experiences/coach-pick.html:68
msgid ""
"Your card is only ever shown to a match your coach chose — no public "
"browsing, ever."
msgstr ""
"Deine Karte wird nur einem Match gezeigt, das Dein Coach ausgewählt hat — "
"nie öffentlich durchstöberbar."

#: templates/crush_lu/crush_connect/experiences/in-the-mix.html:4
msgid "In the Mix — Crush Connect"
msgstr "In the Mix — Crush Connect"

#: templates/crush_lu/crush_connect/experiences/in-the-mix.html:19
#: views_crush_connect.py:1396
msgid "Verified, discoverable, free — forever."
msgstr "Verifiziert, auffindbar, kostenlos — für immer."

#: templates/crush_lu/crush_connect/experiences/in-the-mix.html:22
msgid ""
"In the Mix is Crush Connect's free track. Verify once with LuxID, answer "
"your 3 questions, and you're discoverable: coaches can pick you for a "
"Premium member's week, Drops can surface you, Sparks can find you. No "
"subscription — LuxID verification is what keeps Crush Connect real people "
"only."
msgstr ""
"In the Mix ist der kostenlose Weg in Crush Connect. Verifiziere Dich einmal "
"mit LuxID, beantworte Deine 3 Fragen, und Du bist auffindbar: Coaches können "
"Dich für die Woche eines Premium-Mitglieds auswählen, Drops können Dich "
"zeigen, Sparks können Dich finden. Kein Abo — die LuxID-Verifizierung sorgt "
"dafür, dass Crush Connect nur aus echten Menschen besteht."

#: templates/crush_lu/crush_connect/experiences/in-the-mix.html:34
msgid ""
"Connect your LuxID — free, takes a minute, confirms you're a real person."
msgstr ""
"Verbinde Deine LuxID — kostenlos, dauert eine Minute, bestätigt, dass Du "
"eine echte Person bist."

#: templates/crush_lu/crush_connect/experiences/in-the-mix.html:40
msgid ""
"Complete the short Connect onboarding and pick your 3 questions — that's "
"your card done."
msgstr ""
"Durchlaufe das kurze Connect-Onboarding und wähle Deine 3 Fragen — fertig "
"ist Deine Karte."

#: templates/crush_lu/crush_connect/experiences/in-the-mix.html:46
msgid ""
"You're in the mix. We tell you the moment someone reads you right or a coach "
"picks you."
msgstr ""
"Du bist mit dabei. Wir sagen Dir sofort Bescheid, wenn Dich jemand richtig "
"liest oder ein Coach Dich auswählt."

#: templates/crush_lu/crush_connect/experiences/in-the-mix.html:60
msgid "See your status"
msgstr "Deinen Status ansehen"

#: templates/crush_lu/crush_connect/experiences/in-the-mix.html:65
msgid "Join the mix — free"
msgstr "Mach mit — kostenlos"

